163	## Fallbacking & Browser Support
164	
165	### Fallbacks & browser support for :user-valid and :user-invalid
166	
167	Baseline status for :user-valid and :user-invalid: Widely available. It's been Baseline since 2023-11-02.
168	Supported by: Chrome 119 (Oct 2023), Edge 119 (Nov 2023), Firefox 88 (Apr 2021), and Safari 16.5 (May 2023).
169	
170	### CSS for Fallback
171	
172	```css
