294	* Announce an error that appears when the user leaves or changes a field through one polite live region for the page, a moment later so it doesn't talk over the next field. Don't make each error message a live region: a live region that is shown, rather than changed, isn't announced reliably. After a failed submit, move focus to the first invalid field so that its error is announced instead.
