596	## Fallbacking & Browser Support
597	
598	### Fallbacks & browser support for :user-valid and :user-invalid
599	
600	Baseline status for :user-valid and :user-invalid: Widely available. It's been Baseline since 2023-11-02.
601	Supported by: Chrome 119 (Oct 2023), Edge 119 (Nov 2023), Firefox 88 (Apr 2021), and Safari 16.5 (May 2023).
602	
603	### CSS for Fallback
604	
605	```css
